31eb3edb-af85-4df9-ac0a-c813aca4baae	60186569-a432-4375-9bee-485c69f086d5	4c073a7a-7864-4341-85ce-869914b3c117	\N	SmartCourt_Safety_Threshold_2026.pdf	GLOBAL ACADEMY SPORTS FACILITY COMPLIANCE REGISTRY ======================================================================== This manual outlines the strict safety criteria and structural tolerance limits governing all active tennis court installations within the facility grid. CRITERIA 1: SURFACE CRACK INDEX (SAFETY BREACH) If any physical court installation registers a Surface Crack Index width exceeding 2.5mm, it poses an immediate tripping hazard to athletes. The operational protocol mandates that the court status must be changed to 'Maintenance_Locked' instantly. No active bookings are permitted until a sub-surface sealing layer is applied. CRITERIA 2: STRUCTURAL DELAMINATION INDEX Any court displaying a surface delamination area greater than 10.0% of the total playing zone fails corporate structural warranty compliance parameters. The administrative system must flag that specific Court Asset ID as 'Maintenance_Locked' until an inspector from PremiumCourts LLC evaluates the aggregate base layers.	1	[-0.010795593,0.095947266,0.0713501,0.0013999939,0.005428314,0.031097412,-0.0005121231,-0.10620117,0.0112838745,0.008392334,0.042144775,-0.03225708,-0.029220581,0.023086548,0.030670166,-0.0020751953,0.00036931038,-0.004558563,-0.008728027,-0.017120361,0.06842041,0.05206299,-0.03286743,-0.01309967,0.01966858,-0.039855957,0.04309082,-0.044891357,0.07006836,0.012512207,0.03074646,0.00116539,0.0071258545,-0.015335083,0.02067566,0.0010070801,-0.0036239624,0.03164673,0.016174316,0.007259369,0.037353516,0.022125244,-0.008651733,-0.023254395,-0.06689453,0.01876831,0.03475952,0.01096344,-0.024765015,0.018432617,0.015670776,0.027877808,0.023956299,-0.02772522,-0.008094788,0.027664185,-0.009666443,0.056762695,0.0063285828,-0.0115356445,-0.011543274,0.026046753,-0.013519287,-0.009757996,0.0075035095,-0.013893127,-0.03717041,0.04727